<SiteLayout title="8th Pay Commission Salary by Level: Levels 1 to 18" description="8th Pay Commission salary for all 18 levels: entry basic pay today and at 1.92, 2.28, 2.57, 2.86 and 3.83 fitment. Includes Levels 2, 4 and 12 to 18." slug="8th-pay-commission-salary-all-levels" h1="8th Pay Commission Salary by Level (1 to 18)" lead="Entry basic pay for every level, today and under clearly labelled scenarios." faq={faq} toc={toc} related={related} pageType="article" breadcrumbLabel="Salary by Level">

<div class="answer"><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> The 8th Pay Commission has not announced a fitment factor, so no one can say your exact new salary. The table shows entry basic pay for all 18 levels today and what it would become at four illustrative factors (1.92, 2.28, 2.57 and 2.86) and at the staff-side demand of 3.83. Levels 1, 3 and 5 to 11 also have their own detailed pages.</p></div>

